  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  UIPanel: {fileID: 438204023}
  canvas: {fileID: 936148650}
  panelHAlignment: 1
  panelVAlignment: 1
  textAlignment: 1
  autoStart: 1
  defaultHeight: 100
  defaultWidth: 120
  messageList:
  - "Hi, welcome to the Advanced Scrolling Panel Asset! \r\nJust click on me to display
    the next message."
  - This asset let you display any message and parametrize it as you want !
  - "You can also :\r\n - easily add custom icons in your texts : #W15#01, #W30#06,
    #W30#09, #W30#25 #W30... !\r\n - use it to show instructions on a controller (GamePad,
    Keyboard, Mouse) for users"
  - Here are some examples of what can be done with this asset.
  - "You can customize your text by adding pauses.#W20 It gives#W50\r\n.#W20.#W20.#W40
    , .#W20.#W20.#W40\r\nmore power and sense to it."
  - 'Use the #G00 button to validate'
  - 'Use the combination #G01 + #G07 to activate the magic shield'
  - 'You can run by pushing #G12 button'
  - "Game instructions :\r\n#K33Enter : Jump\r\n#K89Left Shift : Run\r\n#K30#K56#K84#K94Use
    the arrow keys #59 to move."
  - 'Just right click #M01 on the target to make a selection'
  - 'Tap on screen #00 to display the next message.'
  - I wish you a great time testing this asset.
  - Now click on 'Next Style' button to display the next message.
  nbrCharactersByLine: 50
  textScrollingSpeed: 1
  openingSpeed: 2
  messageDuration: 5
  automaticPageSwitch: 0
  closingAnimation: 1
  closingAnimationSpeed: 1
